	(text "100 mA per lamp is a DESIGN ALLOCATION, not a measured lamp current. 32 lamps = 3.2 A.\nXH cable mating parts: XHP-4 + 4 x SXH-001T-P0.6 per button. Accepts 22-28 AWG; strain-relieve.\nAdafruit 1194: 3835 pigtails fit switch tabs; 3838 fit lamp tabs. See BOM for pack quantities.\nReplace pigtail 2-pin ends with genuine XH contacts / 4-pin housing. Menu-button tab sizes UNVERIFIED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 273 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "26e1717e-82f7-4683-b437-88d0301c05ea")
	)
