	(text "Jx: 1=+12V lamp, 2=switched lamp cathode, 3=switch NO, 4=switch COM/GND.\nAdafruit 1194 includes an LED resistor for operation up to 12 V. No extra series resistor fitted.\nEG STARTS menu lamps specified as 12 V; current / tab dimensions need confirmation.\nUse normally-open contacts; leave any NC switch terminal insulated and unused."
